                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Smoke Launcher: Projectile speed increased to 2900 (was 2500)",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Smoke Launcher: Pull out time reduced to 0.25 (was 0.35)",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Smoke Launcher: Cooldown reduced to 30s (was 35s)",
                    "[Tactical] Adjust -> Smoke Launcher: Smoke now reactive: ordnance and abilities can disable it for 5s when used inside/nearby",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Rolling Thunder: Cooldown reduced to 210s (was 270s)",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Rolling Thunder: Reduced anim frame to fire projectile to 1 (was 5)",
                    "[Perks] Removed ->  Ultimate Cooldown+ & Tactical Cooldown",
                    "[Perks] Adjust -> Cover Me: moved to Level 2",
                    "[Perks] Adjust -> Electric Smoke: electrifies Tac dealing 100 damage to enemy Ults and destroys Tacs",
                    "[Perks] Removed -> Refuge: integrated into Cover Me",
                    "[Perks] New -> ECM Payload: electrifies Ult dealing 10 more damage, destroys enemy deployables",
                    "[Perks] New -> Medal of Honor: faster revives and passive triggers running towards knocked allies"
                ]
            }
        ],
        "Caustic": [
            {
                "patch": "Showdown Patch Notes (2025-08-04)",
                "details": [
                    "[Passive] Buff -> Nox Gas: Damage Increased to 10-15 (was 4-10)",
                    "[Passive] Adjust -> Nox Gas: Now causes aim punch to victims when causing damage",
                    "[Passive] Adjust -> Nox Gas: Caustic’s Health Bar does not show while inside",
                    "[Passive] Adjust -> Nox Gas: Increased visibility both outside and inside his own gas. Green highlighting is still active. Clouds now have threat indicators for victims.",
                    "[Passive] Adjust -> Nox Gas: Now Grounds enemies: slowing them once and draining them of movement cooldowns",
                    "[Passive] Adjust -> Nox Gas: “Slow” changed: immediately drains velocity to the desired speed even if the target is moving at high velocity or in the air",
                    "[Passive] Adjust -> Nox Gas: Gas now reactive: ordnance and abilities can disable it for 5s when used inside/nearby",
                    "[Passive] New -> Field Research: Gain research points from poisoning enemies, opening unique Death Boxes, and scanning ring consoles. Unlock an upgrade point for every 100 research points (max 2).",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Nox Gas Trap: Trap health increased to 225 (was 150)",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Nox Gas Trap: Trap can be activated earlier while inflating",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Nox Gas Trap: Reduced toss and stow by 0.1s",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Nox Gas Trap: Increased trap activation radius to 260 (was 140)",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Nox Gas Trap: Increased gas radius to 300 (was 282)",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Nox Gas Trap: Doubled lifetime to 22s (was 11s)",
                    "[Tactical] Adjust -> Nox Gas Trap: Caustic traps take ring damage",
                    "[Tactical] Nerf -> Nox Gas Trap: Increased activation delay to 0.8s (was 0.2s)",
                    "[Tactical] Adjust -> Nox Gas Trap: Traps take bullet damage while inflating",
                    "[Tactical] Adjust -> Nox Gas Trap: Traps take critical (1.4x) damage when hit in the o-ring/base",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Nox Gas Grenade: Reduced cooldown to 2min (was 3m)",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Nox Gas Grenade: Reduced toss and stow time by 0.05s",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Nox Gas Grenade: Increased projectile speed to 1500 (was 1300)",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Nox Gas Grenade: Increase duration to 20s (was 15s)",
                    "[Perks] Removed -> Parabolic Force & Residual Toxins (integrated into base kit)",
                    "[Perks] New -> Extra Traps: one additional charge, increased max in world by 2",
                    "[Perks] Adjust -> Breathe It In: moved to Level 2",
                    "[Perks] New -> Gas Fighter: Tac recharges 300% faster while in gas",
                    "[Perks] Adjust -> Particle Diffuser: increases Ult radius by +50%"
